  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a small bowl, mix together savory, salsa verde, garlic, ginger, fish sauce, brown sugar, and chili flakes.",
    "3. Brush the mixture onto both sides of the chicken breasts.",
    "4. Grill the chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "5. Let the chicken rest for 5 minutes before slicing.",
